# Phase 5-E1 - LOCAL paid Financial Modeling Prep (FMP) data. DO NOT COMMIT.
#
# research/run_phase5e1_fmp_controlled_backfill.py --live writes licensed FMP
# payloads here:
#   raw/        verbatim provider JSON responses (paid data)
#   normalized/ flattened point-in-time CSVs derived from the paid data
#
# These are paid, license-restricted provider responses and must never enter
# Git. Only summarized coverage/quality/manifest data (row counts, redacted
# URLs, file paths - never the payloads or the API key) is written to the
# committed artifacts under research/output/phase5e1_fmp_controlled_backfill/.
raw/
normalized/

# Belt-and-braces: ignore everything in this directory EXCEPT this .gitignore,
# so no paid payload can ever be staged from here by accident.
*
!.gitignore
